// Observables of the LOINC Ontology module without a LOINC code (11)
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1335901007 "Detection of Adenovirus antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1335895009 "Detection of Dependoparvovirus antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#364301000119102 "Detection of Helicobacter pylori antigen in stool (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1335902000 "Detection of Human herpes simplex virus antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#364321000119106 "Detection of Legionella pneumophila antigen in urine (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1335896005 "Detection of Lentivirus antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1335897001 "Detection of Retroviridae antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#364351000119103 "Detection of Streptococcus pneumoniae antigen in urine (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1290195007 "Detection of antibody to infective organism (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871552002 "Detection of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 antibody (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871553007 "Detection of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 antigen (observable entity)"
// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)|), 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = (<< 312301006 |Infective organism antibody (substance)| OR << 116633006 |Microbial antigen (substance)|)"
